"MIME-Version: 1.0\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\n"
"Language: ga\n"

#. Translators: A detection mode: no language detection.
msgid "Off"
msgstr "as feidhm"

#. Translators: A detection mode: only text in another writing system is switched.
msgid "By script only"
msgstr "De réir scripte amháin"

#. Translators: A detection mode: text in the default script is detected clause by clause too.
msgid "Full"
msgstr "Iomlán"

#. Translators: The name of the add-on's script category and settings panel.
msgid "Multilanguage"
msgstr "Ilteangach"

#. Translators: Description of a script.
msgid "Cycles language detection: off, by script only, full"
msgstr "Athraíonn brath teanga: as, de réir scripte amháin, iomlán"

#. Translators: Reported when the detection mode changes; %s is the mode's name.
msgid "Language detection %s"
msgstr "Brath teanga: %s"

#. Translators: Description of a script.
msgid "Toggles strict language detection"
msgstr "Cuireann brath dian teanga ann nó as"

#. Translators: Reported when strict mode is turned on or off.
msgid "Strict detection on"
msgstr "Brath dian ann"

#. Translators: Reported when strict mode is turned on or off.
msgid "Strict detection off"
msgstr "Brath dian as"

#. Translators: Shown in the languages list while the Windows dictionary is being installed.
msgid "installing"
msgstr "á shuiteáil"

#. Translators: Shown in the languages list when whether the language's Windows dictionary is
msgid "unknown"
msgstr "anaithnid"

#. Translators: Shown in the languages list when the language's Windows dictionary is missing.
msgid "missing"
msgstr "ar iarraidh"

#. Translators: Shown in the languages list when the language's Windows dictionary is installed.
msgid "installed"
msgstr "suiteáilte"

#. Translators: Asks to install the Windows dictionary; %s is a language name.
msgid "You will be asked to grant administrator permission to install the Windows dictionary for %s. It is required for accurate language detection."
msgstr "Iarrfar cead riarthóra ort chun foclóir Windows a shuiteáil don teanga %s. Tá sé riachtanach le teanga a bhrath go cruinn."

#. Translators: Title of the dialogs about the Windows dictionary install.
msgid "Windows dictionary"
msgstr "Foclóir Windows"

#. Translators: Message when the elevated install did not start.
msgid "Not started: administrator permission was not given."
msgstr "Níor tosaíodh: níor tugadh cead riarthóra."

#. Translators: Announced when the dictionary install starts; %s is a language name.
msgid "Installing the %s dictionary. NVDA will report when done."
msgstr "Foclóir %s á shuiteáil. Cuirfidh NVDA in iúl nuair a bheidh sé déanta."

#. Translators: Message when the Windows dictionary finished installing; %s is a language name.
msgid "%s dictionary installed."
msgstr "Foclóir %s suiteáilte."

#. Translators: Message when the install ended but the dictionary is still not found; %s is a language name.
msgid "Install finished, but Windows does not show the %s dictionary yet. Restart Windows."
msgstr "Suiteáil críochnaithe, ach ní thaispeánann Windows foclóir %s fós. Atosaigh Windows."

#. Translators: Message when the install failed; %s is a language name.
msgid "%s dictionary did not install. Check Windows Update, or see the NVDA log."
msgstr "Níor suiteáladh foclóir %s. Seiceáil Windows Update nó logchomhad NVDA."

#. Translators: Label of the detection mode combo box.
msgid "Language &detection:"
msgstr "&Brath teanga:"

#. Translators: Label of a check box.
msgid "&Strict: also require Windows language detection to agree"
msgstr "&Dian: bíodh brath teanga Windows ar aon intinn freisin"

#. Translators: Label of a check box.
msgid "Detect inside text &tagged with the default language"
msgstr "Braith freisin i dtéacs atá &clibeáilte leis an teanga réamhshocraithe"

#. Translators: Label of a check box.
msgid "Use &Windows voices for languages the synthesizer cannot speak"
msgstr "Úsáid guthanna &Windows do theangacha nach labhraíonn an sintéiseoir"

#. Translators: Label of the combo box that picks the synthesizer for the default language.
msgid "Default s&ynthesizer:"
msgstr "S&intéiseoir réamhshocraithe:"

#. Translators: Label of the languages list; the default language has no row.
msgid "&Languages (the default needs no row):"
msgstr "&Teangacha (ní gá ró don teanga réamhshocraithe):"

#. Translators: Column headers of the languages list.
msgid "Language"
msgstr "Teanga"

#. Translators: Column headers of the languages list.
msgid "Synthesizer"
msgstr "Sintéiseoir"

#. Translators: Column headers of the languages list.
msgid "Voice"
msgstr "Guth"

#. Translators: Column headers of the languages list.
msgid "Rate"
msgstr "Ráta"

#. Translators: Column headers of the languages list.
msgid "Pitch"
msgstr "Airde"

#. Translators: Column headers of the languages list.
msgid "Volume"
msgstr "Láine"

#. Translators: Column headers of the languages list.
msgid "Symbols"
msgstr "Siombailí"

#. Translators: Column headers of the languages list.
msgid "Dictionary"
msgstr "Foclóir"

#. Translators: Buttons of the languages list.
msgid "&Add..."
msgstr "&Cuir Leis..."

msgid "&Edit..."
msgstr "&Eagar..."

msgid "&Remove"
msgstr "&Bain"

#. Translators: Button that checks whether the selected language's Windows language pack (its dictionary) is installed and offers to install it.
msgid "&Verify language pack..."
msgstr "&Fíoraigh pacáiste teanga..."

#. Translators: Button that edits the voice dictionary of the selected row's voice.
msgid "V&oice dictionary..."
msgstr "Foclóir &gutha..."

#. Translators: A note in the settings panel.
msgid "Each row speaks with its own synthesizer and voice."
msgstr "Labhraíonn gach ró lena shintéiseoir agus lena ghuth féin."

#. Translators: A note in the settings panel; %s is the current synthesizer.
msgid "%s picks its own voice per language; its rows set rate, pitch, and volume. Rows for other synthesizers, and Windows voices, are hosted automatically."
msgstr "Roghnaíonn %s a ghuth féin do gach teanga; socraíonn a rónna luas, airde agus airde fuaime. Óstáiltear rónna do shintéiseoirí eile agus guthanna Windows go huathoibríoch."

#. Translators: Message when whether the selected language's Windows dictionary is installed could
msgid "Could not check the %s dictionary. See the NVDA log."
msgstr "Níorbh fhéidir foclóir %s a sheiceáil. Féach logchomhad NVDA."

#. Translators: Message when the selected language's Windows dictionary is already installed; %s is its name.
msgid "The %s dictionary is installed."
msgstr "Tá foclóir %s suiteáilte."

#. Translators: Message when the selected row has no voice whose dictionary could be edited.
msgid "This row has no voice of its own, so the synthesizer's voice dictionary applies to it."
msgstr "Níl guth dá cuid féin ag an ró seo, mar sin baineann foclóir gutha an tsintéiseora leis."

#. Translators: Title of the messages about a row voice's dictionary.
msgid "Voice dictionary"
msgstr "Foclóir gutha"

#. Translators: Title of the dictionary dialog for a row's voice; %s is the voice and its synthesizer.
msgid "Voice dictionary for %s"
msgstr "Foclóir gutha do %s"

#. Translators: Message when a synthesizer fails to load.
msgid "Synthesizer could not be loaded. See the NVDA log."
msgstr "Níorbh fhéidir an sintéiseoir a lódáil. Féach logchomhad NVDA."

#. Translators: Message when a synthesizer cannot be loaded.
msgid "Error"
msgstr "Earráid"

#. Translators: Title of the dialog that edits a language of the table.
msgid "Edit language"
msgstr "Cuir teanga in eagar"

#. Translators: Title of the dialog that edits a language of the table.
msgid "Add language"
msgstr "Cuir teanga leis"

#. Translators: Label of the synthesizer combo box in the language dialog.
msgid "&Synthesizer:"
msgstr "&Sintéiseoir:"

#. Translators: Label of the voice combo box in the language dialog.
msgid "&Voice:"
msgstr "&Guth:"

#. Translators: Label of the variant combo box in the language dialog.
msgid "V&ariant:"
msgstr "M&alairt:"

#. Translators: Label of the language combo box in the language dialog.
msgid "&Language:"
msgstr "&Teanga:"

#. Translators: Labels of the parameter sliders in the language dialog.
msgid "&Rate"
msgstr "&Ráta"

#. Translators: Labels of the parameter sliders in the language dialog.
msgid "&Pitch"
msgstr "A&irde"

#. Translators: Labels of the parameter sliders in the language dialog.
msgid "V&olume"
msgstr "&Láine"

#. Translators: Labels of the parameter sliders in the language dialog.
msgid "&Inflection"
msgstr "&Casadh"

#. Translators: Label of a check box in the language dialog.
msgid "Rate &boost"
msgstr "Méadú rá&ta"

#. Translators: Label of the combo box that picks how much punctuation and how many symbols are
msgid "Pu&nctuation/symbol level:"
msgstr "&Leibhéal poncaíochta/siombailí:"

#. Translators: The choice that speaks this language's punctuation at NVDA's own level.
msgid "Same as NVDA"
msgstr "Mar an gcéanna le NVDA"

#. Translators: Label of the button that speaks a sample with the chosen voice.
msgid "&Test"
msgstr "&Tástáil"

#. Translators: Message when the language field is empty.
msgid "Enter a language."
msgstr "Cuir teanga isteach."

#. Translators: Message when the language field holds something other than a language code; %s is the text.
msgid "%s is not a language code. Pick a voice or enter a code such as fr or fr_FR."
msgstr "Ní cód teanga é %s. Roghnaigh guth nó cuir cód isteach ar nós fr nó fr_FR."

#. Translators: Asks whether a new or edited row replaces another row for the same language; %s is
msgid "There is already a row for %s. Replace it?"
msgstr "Tá ró ann cheana do %s. É a athsholáthar?"

#. Translators: Title of the message that asks whether to replace a language's row.
msgid "Replace language"
msgstr "Athsholáthair teanga"

#. Translators: The language lock's value when languages switch as configured.
msgid "Automatic"
msgstr "Uathoibríoch"

#. Translators: Name of the synthesizer that speaks each language with its own synthesizer and voice.
msgid "Language table (multilanguage)"
msgstr "Tábla teangacha (ilteangach)"

